# YinPhone admin (Vite) — copy to `.env` and adjust.
#
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ reach the browser, and Vite inlines them
# into the bundle at build time. Treat every value here as public — no secrets.
#
# Left blank, the app calls `/api` on its own origin, which is what `pnpm dev`
# and `pnpm start` already forward to http://localhost:4000 in vite.config.ts.
# Local development therefore needs no configuration at all.
#
# Set this only when the admin is served from a different origin than the API
# (for example a static host in front of a separate API host):
#   VITE_API_URL="https://api.yinphone.shop/api"
# That origin must also be listed in the API's CORS_ORIGINS, and because the
# session cookie is SameSite=Lax the two hosts must be same-site for sign-in
# to work.
VITE_API_URL="http://localhost:4000"
